+/* bbport (BB_KK_TRANSFER_WAIT, vk mode only): 1 (default) = a Vulkan barrier
+ * whose destination names a transfer stage (COPY, CLEAR, BLIT, RESOLVE,
+ * ALL_TRANSFER) holds the next render encoder's vertex stage, as patch 0005
+ * shipped. 0 = transfer destinations count as not vertex-side: every transfer
+ * consumer already waits on all prior queue work in vk mode (copies and query
+ * copies in a compute encoder that starts with barrierAfterQueueStages(ALL),
